line 1 (stair): stair: `start` [x, y] is required

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'stair {"start": [0, 0], "end": [0, 0]}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (stair): stair: `end` must be away from `start`: it says which way the stair climbs

